    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37419" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξίσ-ωσις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equalization</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3546.18
			</span></i> (Pergam.); 
